BaseConfigLib::initializeSubPolicies
├── given zero sub-policies
│   └── it should return remaining data unchanged
├── given single sub-policy with no init data
│   ├── it should write sub-policy address to storage for fieldId
│   ├── it should call initializeWithMultiplexer on sub-policy
│   └── it should return remaining calldata
├── given single sub-policy with init data
│   ├── it should write sub-policy address to storage for fieldId
│   ├── it should call initializeWithMultiplexer with init data
│   └── it should return remaining calldata
├── given multiple sub-policies
│   ├── it should write all sub-policies to storage
│   ├── it should call initializeWithMultiplexer on each
│   └── it should return remaining calldata
├── given extra data after sub-policies
│   └── it should return extra data as remaining
├── given configId and account are passed correctly
│   └── it should pass configId and account to initializeWithMultiplexer
└── given fieldId mode is not SUBPOLICY
    └── it should revert with InvalidMode